{"feed":{"entry":[{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom","xmlns$blogger":"http://schemas.google.com/blogger/2008","xmlns$georss":"http://www.georss.org/georss","xmlns$gd":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005","xmlns$thr":"http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0","id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-6818054921907446479.post-679253282450295082"},"published":{"$t":"2015-06-14T21:38:00.002+02:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2015-06-22T10:44:05.195+02:00"},"title":{"type":"text","$t":"Informačné tabule Dolné Orešany - Slepý vrch"},"content":{"type":"html","$t":"<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nV horúci júnový deň 13.6.2015 sa konala ďalšia akcia nášho Občianskeho združenia Hradiská - osadenie dvoch informačných tabúľ v Dolných Orešanoch, ktoré sa týkajú keltského hradiska s názvom Slepý vrch.&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgya_I8pPwQK7aB-uDCGPFgofAAGwRdTAoTb8lzLD7rWMKInRrnrQn4I4KAAet8avcw74MfNOyNl7lTttZgY3qURGrpicBU496eqPZOW-280jgiVnmjjQc-vc4jCmNDccTSJW6vPOmheSU/s1600/10353229_890040171056528_1606742880164590453_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgya_I8pPwQK7aB-uDCGPFgofAAGwRdTAoTb8lzLD7rWMKInRrnrQn4I4KAAet8avcw74MfNOyNl7lTttZgY3qURGrpicBU496eqPZOW-280jgiVnmjjQc-vc4jCmNDccTSJW6vPOmheSU/s320/10353229_890040171056528_1606742880164590453_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjfWMS3LrxhZoFADkr80ejqZKBuEmbTDnzhy1hFKZiPaIHvla2d7rdLSaH9fLt_fPlWf6Ykk3WYKO96wKibhXV95ldOB9EbNeaPpbz6yLM9P5-0NkuPrB7VpD5wM-cLhVpXNqAoQEfvYyM/s1600/1888626_890040327723179_3925671154322013866_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjfWMS3LrxhZoFADkr80ejqZKBuEmbTDnzhy1hFKZiPaIHvla2d7rdLSaH9fLt_fPlWf6Ykk3WYKO96wKibhXV95ldOB9EbNeaPpbz6yLM9P5-0NkuPrB7VpD5wM-cLhVpXNqAoQEfvYyM/s320/1888626_890040327723179_3925671154322013866_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhugCamh6kQPFp5xVXBnWPeO2GMJ29mSS9plwUztCm971QeD5vmEwLy2QyDhyCiigbB0qwjZ97l_4EWnNK8XWQ6YTvR-1us7lqBQN-Atf3CRB0aHCCMt0NTa7pV-D-ZfhWaUeypOcgy-3U/s1600/11393082_10153296803157347_8369957063735334397_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhugCamh6kQPFp5xVXBnWPeO2GMJ29mSS9plwUztCm971QeD5vmEwLy2QyDhyCiigbB0qwjZ97l_4EWnNK8XWQ6YTvR-1us7lqBQN-Atf3CRB0aHCCMt0NTa7pV-D-ZfhWaUeypOcgy-3U/s320/11393082_10153296803157347_8369957063735334397_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh1lbhRLyrSzXOPrJrlKyO__CEwKhNeYTHLvnaM8VE-dbt8JhhaUAZTJLYFxmvGe4PPH5SaxyizNYjrGbRb5m04yAjf96CD4qh0KObzFOpjURnssW3CYt0evuK_ZDe0vhsLb-K3DOvS7LM/s1600/11401585_890040371056508_1272966211306808840_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh1lbhRLyrSzXOPrJrlKyO__CEwKhNeYTHLvnaM8VE-dbt8JhhaUAZTJLYFxmvGe4PPH5SaxyizNYjrGbRb5m04yAjf96CD4qh0KObzFOpjURnssW3CYt0evuK_ZDe0vhsLb-K3DOvS7LM/s320/11401585_890040371056508_1272966211306808840_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj0xbuhvFJQBkD-oDfeNAJUH2szdr8YMwfE7LhW5q9BZuqoaypcj0M_r_drP3qEyc292Bh3_GL4hJ0N_SPQMnxlck-yhuVtQrOxLLozPiMoFIdZTRuH3qABm4-mBA8BQeKvlPeAH2IU6Q8/s1600/11055259_10153296802517347_8062357822662303428_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj0xbuhvFJQBkD-oDfeNAJUH2szdr8YMwfE7LhW5q9BZuqoaypcj0M_r_drP3qEyc292Bh3_GL4hJ0N_SPQMnxlck-yhuVtQrOxLLozPiMoFIdZTRuH3qABm4-mBA8BQeKvlPeAH2IU6Q8/s320/11055259_10153296802517347_8062357822662303428_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nStretli sme sa s mimoriadne ústretovým prístupom zo strany starostky Dolných Orešian pani Juliany Belicovej, ktorá nielen že prisľúbila financovnie oboch tabúľ, ale spolu s obecným úradom a ďalšími občanmi nám poskytli úžasnú podporu, vďaka ktorej na akciu prišlo množstvo ľudí a atmosféra bola skvelá. </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNajskôr sme osadili prvú tabuľu v centre obce, v blízkosti obecného úradu, na ktorej sa turisti môžu dozvedieť o existencii hradiska na Slepom vrchu a dočítajú sa o najstaršom osídlení Dolných Orešian v praveku. Príhovor k prítomným mal aj archeológ KPU Trnava pán Mgr. Matúš Sládok, ktorý okrem iného informoval o probléme vykrádania archeologických lokalít a ich ochrane.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNásledne sme sa presunuli priamo na hradisko Slepý vrch, kde na návštevníkov čakalo prekvapenie - Kelti. Naše pozvanie totiž prijala <a href=\"http://www.kelti.info/\" target=\"_blank\">renomovaná skupina venujúca sa oživovaniu keltskej histórie - Vae Victis z Lietavskej Lúčky</a>. Na hradisku mali postavený dobový tábor a tkáčske krosná&nbsp; a samozrejme, že sami boli oblečení ako Kelti s príslušným výstrojom. Predviedli nám spôsob života Keltov, pútavo nám o ňom porozprávali a ich druid Brendyx na záver s medovinou požehnal našu tabuľu, aby slúžila dlhú dobu, na slávu keltských bohov.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFPp2sR3N2M6MIzZJRQKZWDk-Gboz484G6KdoNsARrbxqBiix3726EZwQS3Pc7T6ph1r6kH3k6fEWp6NimTqYUZxNsvvqjFp0BmygwuPsL26OshpNbNvIO9G_c18YCBeNjrHnjg-xy8Rc/s1600/11407052_10153296839052347_7403677381445993910_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiFPp2sR3N2M6MIzZJRQKZWDk-Gboz484G6KdoNsARrbxqBiix3726EZwQS3Pc7T6ph1r6kH3k6fEWp6NimTqYUZxNsvvqjFp0BmygwuPsL26OshpNbNvIO9G_c18YCBeNjrHnjg-xy8Rc/s320/11407052_10153296839052347_7403677381445993910_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiTGSW6Y2WWrRP27okiTwTudDt3NQBPtdDYMDcWWuWxQW5borGB_WP8qfFRG-CzJQUDGvZonhSzqzX-OxqZzyNN94Hq_ZSL2SNYdF5vzM-8amJBoOZisvszv2fgMPMTmbTh33MWob3daQU/s1600/11407135_10153296811137347_4784241818692565334_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiTGSW6Y2WWrRP27okiTwTudDt3NQBPtdDYMDcWWuWxQW5borGB_WP8qfFRG-CzJQUDGvZonhSzqzX-OxqZzyNN94Hq_ZSL2SNYdF5vzM-8amJBoOZisvszv2fgMPMTmbTh33MWob3daQU/s320/11407135_10153296811137347_4784241818692565334_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEirLaneuctFF3HvjPlNTWYdO1tBMjTSYikEhMytA0NEsnsct_X6ut4UHezj_no8oRWd4N3YRa7kgsLp7tHkZTEG8Lx484uy5RDQVk69aUAYLaI4QW3YWNAL60tM-odVb3eOYV-yFyfGdz4/s1600/11427170_890041954389683_8163229316847209239_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEirLaneuctFF3HvjPlNTWYdO1tBMjTSYikEhMytA0NEsnsct_X6ut4UHezj_no8oRWd4N3YRa7kgsLp7tHkZTEG8Lx484uy5RDQVk69aUAYLaI4QW3YWNAL60tM-odVb3eOYV-yFyfGdz4/s320/11427170_890041954389683_8163229316847209239_n.jpg\" width=\"213\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicSpECKC3OrsHZawvOQs9MJeOHEaK5OaKOmlCda9qHIagC1DmpS-ird5KnAJSGsd-gF_zxp0TCqaLBosR86eHSdF01n3QwoxC3aWlFBfhhr7xNO_jz0zTpX0-qMt2MrFM56RNeGUXAhWs/s1600/11538079_890041861056359_2010695344170910478_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicSpECKC3OrsHZawvOQs9MJeOHEaK5OaKOmlCda9qHIagC1DmpS-ird5KnAJSGsd-gF_zxp0TCqaLBosR86eHSdF01n3QwoxC3aWlFBfhhr7xNO_jz0zTpX0-qMt2MrFM56RNeGUXAhWs/s320/11538079_890041861056359_2010695344170910478_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nCesta na hradisko s tabuľou na pleci by bola mimoriadne náročná a preto musím vyzdvihnúť obrovskú pomoc pána Lukáša Ilavského z Dolných Orešian, ktorý na hradisko zabezpečil vyviezol všetok potrebný materiál a tiež <span class=\"_5yl5\" data-reactid=\".18v.$mid=11434309515606=2d48fa59fabc63a5b11.2:0.0.0.0.0\"><span data-reactid=\".18v.$mid=11434309515606=2d48fa59fabc63a5b11.2:0.0.0.0.0.0\">Patrika Dobšoviča, ktorý sa postaral o vyvezenie Keltov v a ich výstroja.</span></span> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg7Azl-09yLYQsfGeUur5i3oZPQOyunjcdP2ceyJXjZyfmV8fwzqLczHDAi4wx9JBuOkCQIl7ms3fz3UPIFkW53PnNEKmFaM94vhNhKl12Is98_ajKjaNj75Pp_9R6Kv88wreIDX2kQM70/s1600/11415608_890041071056438_7817830199453127650_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg7Azl-09yLYQsfGeUur5i3oZPQOyunjcdP2ceyJXjZyfmV8fwzqLczHDAi4wx9JBuOkCQIl7ms3fz3UPIFkW53PnNEKmFaM94vhNhKl12Is98_ajKjaNj75Pp_9R6Kv88wreIDX2kQM70/s320/11415608_890041071056438_7817830199453127650_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQf38NpCA1Xq83ddvLuGCVA9mfLN6PE5DvgrmQFe9hV2_ZoS7vokbqGCduYV-yRFCBJMEKEPxs8vAAQFJkmr4rxIZiKrREcpBXbGFU3X08urEQNnPHqXXpx4nmJ0oqDlJbC95RtLAudms/s1600/11224182_890041234389755_6280526007088054881_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjQf38NpCA1Xq83ddvLuGCVA9mfLN6PE5DvgrmQFe9hV2_ZoS7vokbqGCduYV-yRFCBJMEKEPxs8vAAQFJkmr4rxIZiKrREcpBXbGFU3X08urEQNnPHqXXpx4nmJ0oqDlJbC95RtLAudms/s320/11224182_890041234389755_6280526007088054881_o.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhq1Q2KxW4YiT6wjQudx3e8l8hCmqv8K_RYQ9Ud0m-2Ga1eSI5Rw4qdq8x69RmwW71cu6C6N-IyoyMX3j4B1EMPmaruxOEhQLiy0gCK0hb_yKDtqc5z1Giq-dkNe57e-2wgnbFZFof1u18/s1600/11112893_890041444389734_4149237453246171946_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://blogger.google