FriJ_Vtt4iY196LjJoJ8ZMUFIjyGpKEa8tTWEorjg02Ueo6Q9sUKT2KIiunYB_irvoAWgwIb2vdf7m2oFMokAhA8olQ8PsV07zpaGZanKbEwOgowG5DT1DlE/s1600/11390163_10153296816182347_1109824607060673301_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjy9Zc7PEXmnphw-2-eNWLFriJ_Vtt4iY196LjJoJ8ZMUFIjyGpKEa8tTWEorjg02Ueo6Q9sUKT2KIiunYB_irvoAWgwIb2vdf7m2oFMokAhA8olQ8PsV07zpaGZanKbEwOgowG5DT1DlE/s320/11390163_10153296816182347_1109824607060673301_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjf72vdIOETaIRuK8DsY_UWJXCwdW6S6kuonvzGmu2YYyo9SJN3xFgBG3WZDRpaRhXnefbhRhdXZMj8RUuWM4_E1ESW01M3-JwjnKyP9YUzvIFXAlZbmgLer8LlbtMMV5PIN-JCJeXFCes/s1600/11407177_10153296805632347_3530316923632600867_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjf72vdIOETaIRuK8DsY_UWJXCwdW6S6kuonvzGmu2YYyo9SJN3xFgBG3WZDRpaRhXnefbhRhdXZMj8RUuWM4_E1ESW01M3-JwjnKyP9YUzvIFXAlZbmgLer8LlbtMMV5PIN-JCJeXFCes/s320/11407177_10153296805632347_3530316923632600867_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjHYJXbE8ijDJM9_a9oY5j0U3jlEV9kneIBUKYX6XHyGX3MdixtZd8nUcqsoxN6cVLl6uNcwI1cf-L9DKYuzKH2iSxxdduu8jqxbX9kUpdwAAo8L8hkKwVuVDjzrbjoAn9NQTC-0lXjF7A/s1600/11407227_10153296805097347_1838960327207038724_n.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjHYJXbE8ijDJM9_a9oY5j0U3jlEV9kneIBUKYX6XHyGX3MdixtZd8nUcqsoxN6cVLl6uNcwI1cf-L9DKYuzKH2iSxxdduu8jqxbX9kUpdwAAo8L8hkKwVuVDjzrbjoAn9NQTC-0lXjF7A/s320/11407227_10153296805097347_1838960327207038724_n.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNapriek horúcemu počasiu na hradisko prišlo veľké množstvo záujemcov. Na záver si mohli pozrieť štart niekoľkých paraglajdistov zo Slepého vrchu, ktorých účasť taktiež zabezpečila pani starostka. Po návrate do obce sme mali na obecnom úrade prichystaný výborný guláš a pohostenie.&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgNb41pHZpeNwwkD5bK__35SFr7QAwAQt0tdw-Bd05WRwFJEDlilclmSmrwC71Ivq6QfeN3C6HiHtMN8UUlPW8tJs6zjluDcktiuhPSbc6Zu_EGH0p7GcKUjwNkmuLjqhk6umOedCfkTYk/s1600/Oresany_dedina_final+maly%25CC%2581.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"229\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgNb41pHZpeNwwkD5bK__35SFr7QAwAQt0tdw-Bd05WRwFJEDlilclmSmrwC71Ivq6QfeN3C6HiHtMN8UUlPW8tJs6zjluDcktiuhPSbc6Zu_EGH0p7GcKUjwNkmuLjqhk6umOedCfkTYk/s320/Oresany_dedina_final+maly%25CC%2581.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiZ8-IM7MeAuwLavVj2bDB-QH4Le2B8mXyZV-MQrEjswVWwrDdvj44aA-T_ZXPJiGqEVA7Q1hjT9OH9m0A8gUXCtcF0DyLfmdO4foSNq8alQydkwvGEHEcXe1BZyQbl74W9oElq06cDdGA/s1600/Oresany_hradisko_final+maly%25CC%2581.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"229\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiZ8-IM7MeAuwLavVj2bDB-QH4Le2B8mXyZV-MQrEjswVWwrDdvj44aA-T_ZXPJiGqEVA7Q1hjT9OH9m0A8gUXCtcF0DyLfmdO4foSNq8alQydkwvGEHEcXe1BZyQbl74W9oElq06cDdGA/s320/Oresany_hradisko_final+maly%25CC%2581.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nNa tomto mieste sa chcem poďakovať všetkým, ktorí sa na tvorbe tabule podieľali (naši chalani zo združenia), skupine Vae Victis za jej veľký prínos, ale predovšetkým ústretovosti pani starostky. S takýmto skvelým prístupom sme sa ešte nestretli. A samozrejme občanom Orešian, ktorým nieje ľahostajná ich história a ktorí nás prišli vo veľkom počte podporiť. </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTešíme sa na ďalšiu akciu.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nOrgoň</div>\n"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/feeds/679253282450295082/comments/default","title":"Zverejniť komentáre"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2015/06/informacne-tabule-dolne-oresany-slepy.html#comment-form","title":"1 komentárov"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/679253282450295082"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"http://www.blogger.com/feeds/6818054921907446479/posts/default/679253282450295082"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"http://www.hradiska.sk/2015/06/informacne-tabule-dolne-oresany-slepy.html","title":"Informačné tabule Dolné Orešany - Slepý vrch"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Orgon"},"uri":{"$t":"http://www.blogger.com/profile/01396912608531297025"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"32","height":"32","src":"//blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjRf79q2mlg3o6hsyWbYMCCgv1WaA6pM0mtkWB0QdJ76W64emXoS0lwpSlUw9K5iinuoAVrX4RwIXY0RoOkY_QRl8Yy2oMkJAodsY_W7_GnMHXspVw3fuuBpiYA7JlSOlY/s220/SH+Kruh+s+dlznom1.JPG"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgya_I8pPwQK7aB-uDCGPFgofAAGwRdTAoTb8lzLD7rWMKInRrnrQn4I4KAAet8avcw74MfNOyNl7lTttZgY3qURGrpicBU496eqPZOW-280jgiVnmjjQc-vc4jCmNDccTSJW6vPOmheSU/s72-c/10353229_890040171056528_1606742880164590453_o.jpg","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"1"}}]}}